    </bannerImage>
        <bannerTitle>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[Blog Details]]></Value>
    </bannerTitle>
                        <contentBlocks>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[{
  "contentData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000002",
      "key": "b35fc258-c9cb-444e-a3d5-81111f9fb039",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "<div class=\"centro-blog-wrap\">\n<section class=\"centro-hero\">\n\n      <div class=\"centro-eyebrow\">\n        <span class=\"centro-eyebrow-dot\"></span>\n        Awards &amp; Recognition\n      </div>\n\n      <h1>\n        Centro Named to the IAOP Global 100 for the Fourth Consecutive Year\n      </h1>\n\n      <p class=\"centro-lead\">\n        Centro has once again been recognized among the global outsourcing\n        industry&#8217;s distinguished providers, earning a place in the 2026\n        IAOP Global Outsourcing 100 as a Rising Star.\n      </p>\n\n    </section>\n</div>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000003",
      "key": "a1462c47-ba99-4772-8c65-b0f43f8d05a8",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "imageUrl",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "https://centrocdx.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Blog-IAOP.png"
        },
        {
          "alias": "altText",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Centro recognized in the 2026 IAOP Global Outsourcing 100"
        },
        {
          "alias": "caption",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Centro recognized in the 2026 IAOP Global Outsourcing 100"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000002",
      "key": "edc5e72d-68f2-41a8-802b-52d7a453e3d7",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "<div class=\"centro-blog-wrap\"><div class=\"centro-content-width\"><section class=\"centro-section\"><p>The 2026 recognition represents Centro’s fourth consecutive year receiving recognition from the International Association of Outsourcing Professionals (IAOP), reinforcing the company’s sustained momentum within the global outsourcing industry.</p><p>The Global Outsourcing 100 brings visibility to outsourcing service providers from around the world, spanning established industry leaders and emerging organizations demonstrating strong growth, innovation and market impact.</p></section></div></div>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000002",
      "key": "53c091d9-1cb2-48c9-b37f-33a2ab36500c",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "<div class=\"centro-blog-wrap\"><div class=\"centro-content-width\"><section class=\"centro-recognition\"><div class=\"centro-recognition-number\"><strong>4</strong><span>Consecutive Years</span></div><div class=\"centro-recognition-copy\"><span>IAOP Global Outsourcing 100</span><h2>Consistent recognition. Continued momentum.</h2><p>Centro’s fourth consecutive recognition reflects the continued development of its global delivery capabilities and commitment to high-value outsourcing outcomes.</p></div></section></div></div>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000004",
      "key": "0f1eb6c5-7d9e-4605-b79e-80e3f2d394e0",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "heading",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Recognition Built on Outsourcing Excellence"
        },
        {
          "alias": "level",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "[\"h2\"]"
        },
        {
          "alias": "anchorId",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "recognition-excellence"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000002",
      "key": "1bedf5f7-f020-4af5-ad1c-3f918ce51a25",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "<div class=\"centro-blog-wrap\"><div class=\"centro-content-width\"><p>IAOP’s Global Outsourcing 100 is designed to recognize outsourcing providers demonstrating the capabilities, vision and performance required in an evolving global services market.</p><p>For Centro, repeated recognition reflects a broader commitment to building scalable operations, developing world-class talent and delivering measurable value for clients across international markets.</p></div></div>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000009",
      "key": "dda7460e-62e3-492f-9cdc-f3fa45a3fa7c",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "quote",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "“Being recognized as a Rising Star by the IAOP Global 100 for the fourth year running is a powerful validation of our team’s relentless drive and our passion for outsourcing excellence. This honor pushes us to keep raising the bar for what a modern outsourcing company can achieve for our clients.”"
        },
        {
          "alias": "attribution",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Hesham Farag, Executive Chairman & Founder, Centro"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000004",
      "key": "d9ade485-eee5-4998-b0d4-375be6e614b2",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "heading",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "What This Recognition Represents"
        },
        {
          "alias": "level",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "[\"h2\"]"
        },
        {
          "alias": "anchorId",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "recognition-represents"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000002",
      "key": "f650f037-6b81-4e6d-a007-b72255b33f96",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "<div class=\"centro-blog-wrap\"><div class=\"centro-content-width\"><p>Centro continues to strengthen a global delivery model designed to support organizations with scalable outsourcing capabilities across customer experience, technical support and back-office operations.</p><div class=\"centro-impact-grid\"><div class=\"centro-impact-card\"><span class=\"centro-impact-index\">01</span><h3>Global Delivery</h3><p>A delivery model built to support international operations and changing business requirements.</p></div><div class=\"centro-impact-card\"><span class=\"centro-impact-index\">02</span><h3>Scalable Operations</h3><p>Outsourcing capabilities designed to grow alongside client demand and operational complexity.</p></div><div class=\"centro-impact-card\"><span class=\"centro-impact-index\">03</span><h3>Client Outcomes</h3><p>A continued focus on execution, performance and meaningful business impact.</p></div></div></div></div>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000004",
      "key": "2b7871f7-b47f-499c-b62b-cbc796a3d401",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "heading",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "A Shared Achievement"
        },
        {
          "alias": "level",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "[\"h2\"]"
        },
        {
          "alias": "anchorId",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "shared-achievement"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000002",
      "key": "e1ea4aa7-c8d8-4bfb-9827-2dfe8338c031",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "<div class=\"centro-blog-wrap\"><div class=\"centro-content-width\"><p>This recognition belongs to the teams behind Centro’s operations and to the clients who continue to place their trust in the organization.</p><p>As Centro continues to expand its capabilities, the focus remains on developing people, strengthening operations and raising the standard of what businesses can expect from a modern outsourcing partner.</p></div></div>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000002",
      "key": "c2929e2c-52a7-47fc-b8c7-78c8ff66a705",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "<div class=\"centro-blog-wrap\"><div class=\"centro-content-width\"><section class=\"centro-about-box\"><div><h2>About IAOP</h2><p>IAOP is a global association for outsourcing and business services professionals, bringing together customers, providers and advisors through professional development, industry collaboration, recognition and shared expertise.</p></div><a class=\"centro-about-mark\" href=\"https://www.iaop.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Visit the IAOP website\"><span>IAOP</span></a></section></div></div>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000004",
      "key": "5dc692c9-5a68-4b46-a89e-dbf4ce34c717",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "heading",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Frequently Asked Questions"
        },
        {
          "alias": "level",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "[\"h2\"]"
        },
        {
          "alias": "anchorId",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "faq"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000007",
      "key": "093f80e9-9343-482d-a758-3012379cab88",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "question",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Has Centro won BPO industry awards?"
        },
        {
          "alias": "answer",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Yes. Centro has received recognition from major organizations within the outsourcing industry, including repeated recognition in the IAOP Global Outsourcing 100."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000007",
      "key": "07f0d535-f420-4945-9d08-76285fe3dbd7",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "question",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "What is the IAOP Global Outsourcing 100?"
        },
        {
          "alias": "answer",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "The Global Outsourcing 100 is an annual IAOP program recognizing outsourcing service providers from around the world, including established leaders and Rising Stars."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000007",
      "key": "77034229-9e15-4ff2-8ff8-e0b3346597d4",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "question",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "What does IAOP Rising Star recognition mean?"
        },
        {
          "alias": "answer",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Rising Star is a category within the Global Outsourcing 100 that recognizes outsourcing providers demonstrating notable growth, momentum and developing market leadership."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000008",
      "key": "0bd8a444-3901-45d0-b7a0-5666bea4679b",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "eyebrow",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Build With Centro"
        },
        {
          "alias": "title",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Looking for an outsourcing partner built for what comes next?"
        },
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Explore Centro’s Business Process Outsourcing capabilities and discover how our teams support scalable, high-performing operations."
        },
        {
          "alias": "buttonLabel",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Explore Our Solutions"
        },
        {
          "alias": "buttonLink",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "[{\"name\":\"Explore Our Solutions\",\"url\":\"https://centrocdx.com/solution/bpo\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"queryString\":null}]"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
