        <excerpt>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[Centro, a pioneering, Egypt-based business process outsourcing (BPO) provider, has been named to the 2026 IAOP Global 100, recognized as a Rising Star.]]></Value>
    </excerpt>
